mentor-element elementor-element-2c79257 e-grid e-con-boxed e-con e-parent\" data-id=\"2c79257\" data-element_type=\"container\">\n\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"e-con-inner\">\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-aa57bfc elementor-widget elementor-widget-image\" data-id=\"aa57bfc\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-widget_type=\"image.default\">\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-widget-container\">\n\t\t\t<style>\/*! elementor - v3.21.0 - 26-05-2024 *\/\n.elementor-widget-image{text-align:center}.elementor-widget-image a{display:inline-block}.elementor-widget-image a img[src$=\".svg\"]{width:48px}.elementor-widget-image img{vertical-align:middle;display:inline-block}<\/style>\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<img fetchpriority=\"high\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"551\" height=\"551\" src=\"https:\/\/theshaadiknot.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2024\/06\/sumit-tsk.png\" class=\"attachment-full size-full wp-image-8611\" alt=\"\" srcset=\"https:\/\/theshaadiknot.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2024\/06\/sumit-tsk.png 551w, https:\/\/theshaadiknot.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2024\/06\/sumit-tsk-300x300.png 300w, https:\/\/theshaadiknot.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2024\/06\/sumit-tsk-150x150.png 150w\" sizes=\"(max-width: 551px) 100vw, 551px\" \/>\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-0ea41d8 e-flex e-con-boxed e-con e-child\" data-id=\"0ea41d8\" data-element_type=\"container\">\n\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"e-con-inner\">\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-1671a76 elementor-widget elementor-widget-heading\" data-id=\"1671a76\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-widget_type=\"heading.default\">\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-widget-container\">\n\t\t\t<h2 class=\"elementor-heading-title elementor-size-default\">Sumit Singh<\/h2>\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-765f270 elementor-widget elementor-widget-heading\" data-id=\"765f270\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-widget_type=\"heading.default\">\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-widget-container\">\n\t\t\t<h2 class=\"elementor-heading-title elementor-size-default\">Founder, The Shaadi Knot<\/h2>\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-2c83837 color-scheme-inherit text-left elementor-widget elementor-widget-text-editor\" data-id=\"2c83837\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-widget_type=\"text-editor.default\">\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-widget-container\">\n\t\t\t<style>\/*! elementor - v3.21.0 - 26-05-2024 *\/\n.elementor-widget-text-editor.elementor-drop-cap-view-stacked .elementor-drop-cap{background-color:#69727d;color:#fff}.elementor-widget-text-editor.elementor-drop-cap-view-framed .elementor-drop-cap{color:#69727d;border:3px solid;background-color:transparent}.elementor-widget-text-editor:not(.elementor-drop-cap-view-default) .elementor-drop-cap{margin-top:8px}.elementor-widget-text-editor:not(.elementor-drop-cap-view-default) .elementor-drop-cap-letter{width:1em;height:1em}.elementor-widget-text-editor .elementor-drop-cap{float:left;text-align:center;line-height:1;font-size:50px}.elementor-widget-text-editor .elementor-drop-cap-letter{display:inline-block}<\/style>\t\t\t\t<p class=\"p1\">Sumit Singh, the visionary founder behind The Shaadi Knot is the architect behind our exceptional weddings. With a dynamic blend of youthfulness and engineering precision, Sumit brings a fresh perspective to crafting unforgettable weddings. His keen eye for detail, ensures that no aspect of your special day goes overlooked.<\/p><p class=\"p1\">One of Sumit\u2019s defining qualities is his unwavering availability for his clients. Whether it\u2019s a late-night brainstorming session or a last-minute adjustment, Sumit is always there, dedicated to making your dream wedding a reality.<\/p><p class=\"p1\">At the heart of Sumit\u2019s philosophy is a commitment to exceeding expectations. He thrives on the opportunity to go above and beyond, ensuring that every detail is executed flawlessly. With Sumit at the helm, you can trust that your wedding will be nothing short of extraordinary.<\/p>\t\t\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-3c05275 e-grid e-con-boxed e-con e-parent\" data-id=\"3c05275\" data-element_type=\"container\">\n\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"e-con-inner\">\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-d4a14df elementor-position-left elementor-vertical-align-top elementor-widget elementor-widget-image-box\" data-id=\"d4a14df\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-widget_type=\"image-box.default\">\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-widget-container\">\n\t\t\t<style>\/*! elementor - v3.21.0 - 26-05-2024 *\/\n.elementor-widget-image-box .elementor-image-box-content{width:100%}@media (min-width:768px){.elementor-widget-image-box.elementor-position-left .elementor-image-box-wrapper,.elementor-widget-image-box.elementor-position-right .elementor-image-box-wrapper{display:flex}.elementor-widget-image-box.elementor-position-right .elementor-image-box-wrapper{text-align:end;flex-direction:row-reverse}.elementor-widget-image-box.elementor-position-left .elementor-image-box-wrapper{text-align:start;flex-direction:row}.elementor-widget-image-box.elementor-position-top .elementor-image-box-img{margin:auto}.elementor-widget-image-box.elementor-vertical-align-top .elementor-image-box-wrapper{align-items:flex-start}.elementor-widget-image-box.elementor-vertical-align-middle .elementor-image-box-wrapper{align-items:center}.elementor-widget-image-box.elementor-vertical-align-bottom .elementor-image-box-wrapper{align-items:flex-end}}@media (max-width:767px){.elementor-widget-image-box .elementor-image-box-img{margin-left:auto!important;margin-right:auto!important;margin-bottom:15px}}.elementor-widget-image-box .elementor-image-box-img{display:inline-block}.elementor-widget-image-box .elementor-image-box-title a{color:inherit}.elementor-widget-image-box .elementor-image-box-wrapper{text-align:center}.elementor-widget-image-box .elementor-image-box-description{margin:0}<\/style><div class=\"elementor-image-box-wrapper\"><figure class=\"elementor-image-box-img\"><img decoding=\"async\" width=\"480\" height=\"680\" src=\"https:\/\/theshaadiknot.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2024\/06\/kirti-dp-01-1.png\" class=\"attachment-full size-full wp-image-8734\" alt=\"\" srcset=\"https:\/\/theshaadiknot.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2024\/06\/kirti-dp-01-1.png 480w, https:\/\/theshaadiknot.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2024\/06\/kirti-dp-01-1-212x300.png 212w, https:\/\/theshaadiknot.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2024\/06\/elementor\/thumbs\/kirti-dp-01-1-qpg47aaa0dm77xnd16br7v58l2344noqv3ozq8y43s.png 240w\" sizes=\"(max-width: 480px) 100vw, 480px\" \/><\/figure><div class=\"elementor-image-box-content\"><p class=\"elementor-image-box-title\">Kirti Karvee<\/p><p class=\"elementor-image-box-description\">The creative genius of The Shaadi Knot. With a rich background in fashion and lifestyle, Kirti infuses every wedding with a touch of elegance and innovation. She effortlessly curates new concepts and personalizations, ensuring that each wedding is a true reflection of the couple's unique style and personality. <br><br>What truly sets Kirti apart is her ability to connect with our brides on a personal level. She doesn't just plan weddings; she becomes a trusted confidante and the bride's best friend throughout the journey.\n<\/p><\/div><\/div>\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-6d25936 elementor-position-left elementor-vertical-align-top elementor-widget elementor-widget-image-box\" data-id=\"6d25936\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-widget_type=\"image-box.default\">\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-widget-container\">\n\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-image-box-wrapper\"><figure class=\"elementor-image-box-img\"><img decoding=\"async\" width=\"480\" height=\"680\" src=\"https:\/\/theshaadiknot.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2024\/06\/diksha-dp-01.png\" class=\"attachment-full size-full wp-image-8733\" alt=\"\" srcset=\"https:\/\/theshaadiknot.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2024\/06\/diksha-dp-01.png 480w, https:\/\/theshaadiknot.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2024\/06\/diksha-dp-01-212x300.png 212w, https:\/\/theshaadiknot.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2024\/06\/elementor\/thumbs\/diksha-dp-01-qpg40oh3zaknml8sltj5715makn918gnmen5b8qpu0.png 240w\" sizes=\"(max-width: 480px) 100vw, 480px\" \/><\/figure><div class=\"elementor-image-box-content\"><p class=\"elementor-image-box-title\">Diksha Arora<\/p><p class=\"elementor-image-box-description\">The meticulous orchestrator, blends her background in psychology with an unwavering passion for hospitality, ensuring that every guest's experience is nothing short of exceptional. Her analytical mind allows her to anticipate every need and ensure seamless logistics throughout the event. \n<\/br>\n<\/br>\nShe is deeply committed to creating the warmest and most welcoming atmosphere for each guest at the wedding. From personalized check-ins to thoughtful entertainment choices, she curates every aspect of the guest experience to ensure that every guest feels valued.<\/p><\/div><\/div>\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-c142eaa elementor-position-right elementor-vertical-align-top elementor-widget elementor-widget-image-box\" data-id=\"c142eaa\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-widget_type=\"image-box.default\">\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-widget-container\">\n\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-image-box-wrapper\"><figure class=\"elementor-image-box-img\"><img loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"480\" height=\"680\" src=\"https:\/\/theshaadiknot.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2024\/06\/pragya-arora-01.png\" class=\"attachment-full size-full wp-image-8735\" alt=\"\" srcset=\"https:\/\/theshaadiknot.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2024\/06\/pragya-arora-01.png 480w, https:\/\/theshaadiknot.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2024\/06\/pragya-arora-01-212x300.png 212w, https:\/\/theshaadiknot.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2024\/06\/elementor\/thumbs\/pragya-arora-01-qpg4de8iflzaoorvctegfbn3l7z05txxpccm0zvzns.png 240w\" sizes=\"(max-width: 480px) 100vw, 480px\" \/><\/figure><div class=\"elementor-image-box-content\"><p class=\"elementor-image-box-title\">Pragya Arora<\/p><p class=\"elementor-image-box-description\">The indispensable cornerstone of The Shaadi Knot. Obsessive note-taker extraordinaire, Pragya ensures that every minute of every meeting is meticulously recorded. \n<\/br>\n<\/br>\nWith her exceptional memory and attention to detail, she serves as the guardian of your vision, ensuring that no small detail is forgotten amidst the chaos of wedding planning. From reminding family members to coordinating with the team, Pragya is the dependable backbone of our operation, ensuring that your special day unfolds flawlessly from start to finish.\n<\/p><\/div><\/div>\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-c2f3e0a elementor-position-right elementor-vertical-align-top elementor-widget elementor-widget-image-box\" data-id=\"c2f3e0a\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-widget_type=\"image-box.default\">\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-widget-container\">\n\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-image-box-wrapper\"><figure class=\"elementor-image-box-img\"><img loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"480\" height=\"680\" src=\"https:\/\/theshaadiknot.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2024\/06\/kamal-tsk.png\" class=\"attachment-full size-full wp-image-9279\" alt=\"\" srcset=\"https:\/\/theshaadiknot.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2024\/06\/kamal-tsk.png 480w, https:\/\/theshaadiknot.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2024\/06\/kamal-tsk-212x300.png 212w\" sizes=\"(max-width: 480px) 100vw, 480px\" \/><\/figure><div class=\"elementor-image-box-content\"><p class=\"elementor-image-box-title\">Kamal Chawla<\/p><p class=\"elementor-image-box-description\">The dynamic whirlwind fueling our wedding planning team with youthful zeal. As the team's youngest member, Kamal brings a refreshing perspective to every occasion.\n<\/br>\n<\/br>\nYou'll often find Kamal at the heart of the action, running around the event venue to ensure that every detail is executed to perfection. He is the first to arrive, meticulously overseeing preparations and when the last guest departs, Kamal is still there, ensuring that every element is wrapped up seamlessly. Kamal never shies away from the demands of the job, leaving no stone unturned.<\/p><\/div><\/div>\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t","protected":false},"excerpt":{"rendered":"<p>WHO ARE WE Sumit Singh Founder, The Shaadi Knot Sumit Singh, the visionary founder behind The Shaadi Knot is the<\/p>\n","protected":false},"author":1,"featured_media":0,"parent":0,"menu_order":0,"comment_status":"closed","ping_status":"closed","template":"","meta":{"footnotes":""},"class_list":["post-8608","page","type-page","status-publish","hentry"],"_links":{"self":[{"href":"https:\/\/theshaadiknot.com\/wp-json\/wp\/v2\/pages\/8608","targetHints":{"allow":["GET"]}}],"collection":[{"href":"https:\/\/theshaadiknot.com\/wp-json\/wp\/v2\/pages"}],"about":[{"href":"https:\/\/theshaadiknot.com\/wp-json\/wp\/v2\/types\/page"}],"author":[{"embeddable":true,"href":"https:\/\/theshaadiknot.com\/wp-json\/wp\/v2\/users\/1"}],"replies":[{"embeddable":true,"href":"https:\/\/theshaadiknot.com\/wp-json\/wp\/v2\/comments?post=8608"}],"version-history":[{"count":70,"href":"https:\/\/theshaadiknot.com\/wp-json\/wp\/v2\/pages\/8608\/revisions"}],"predecessor-version":[{"id":9282,"href":"https:\/\/theshaadiknot.com\/wp-json\/wp\/v2\/pages\/8608\/revisions\/9282"}],"wp:attachment":[{"href":"https:\/\/theshaadiknot.com\/wp-json\/wp\/v2\/media?parent=8608"}],"curies":[{"name":"wp","href":"https:\/\/api.w.org\/{re